Third-party material

Design values, icon SVGs, brand marks used on the documentation pages and page
screenshots (assets/icons, assets/icons-sprite.svg, assets/brand,
references/screenshots) are derived from these Figma Community files, each
published under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

1. "DuoLingo Design System (Community)" by John Welch
   https://www.figma.com/community/file/1460744749282136015/duolingo-design-system
   File key: Y9HNcdPRyk3mrVUAzHgldI

2. "Duolingo FREE UI Kit - By Marvilo (Community)" by Marvilo
   https://www.figma.com/community/file/1377326303556981356/duolingo-free-ui-kit-by-marvilo
   File key: woBGZQ1U4cS2myXqPfmrzw

3. "Duolingo - Unofficial Design Language (Community)"
   https://www.figma.com/community/file/1439600081437366863/duolingo-unofficial-design-language
   File key: tUtC9p62GJq20mE82XXdz3

Changes made to that material: values normalised into CSS custom properties and
DTCG tokens; SVG ids prefixed with `di-` and made unique; root `fill="none"`
restored on outline icons; sprites assembled; screenshots exported from Figma
and, for the demo cover, re-rendered from this repository's HTML/CSS. The
derived material remains under CC BY 4.0. Attribution must be preserved when
you redistribute it.

The bundled font, assets/fonts/nunito-latin.woff2, is Nunito by the Nunito
Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full licence
text is in assets/fonts/OFL.txt.

"Duolingo", the Duolingo owl, the Duolingo wordmark and related marks are
trademarks or copyrighted works of Duolingo, Inc. This is an unofficial fan
project. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by Duolingo, Inc.
Do not use the brand assets in assets/brand or the mascot illustration as a
product logo, and do not imply an official connection.
